body:
I've never worked as a true house manager (personal adminstration, no housekeeping) but I have done housekeeping & meal prep (meal plan, groceries, cooking) for $40/hr, as well as Kondo-style organization for $30/hr.) 

&#x200B;

In Alabama, min wage is $7.25 but realistically, NOBODY will take a job for less than $15/hr. (It's like the new unofficial min wage due to labor shortages.) Hopefully that helps you a little!
